  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A star initially has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>40</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>deuterons. It produces energy via the processes <math> <mrow> <msub> <mspace></mspace> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mspace></mspace> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>⟶</mo> <msub> <mspace></mspace> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>p</mtext> <mo>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;</mo> <msub> <mspace></mspace> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mspace></mspace> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mo>⟶</mo> <msub> <mspace></mspace> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msup> <mtext>He</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>n</mtext> </mrow> </math>. If the average power radiated by the star is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>, the deuteron supply of the star is exhausted in a time of the order of</p>\r\r<p>(mass of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><none></none><mn>2</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>1</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>014</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>amu</mi></math>, mass of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>He</mi><none></none><mn>4</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>2</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>001</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>amu</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>007</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>amu</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>008</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>amu</mi></math>)</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
